  "notes": [
    "Route: library/:libraryId (authGuard, libraryAccessGuard, libraryResolver) -> child series/:seriesId/manga (app-routing.module.ts:118) -> lazy manga-reader.router.module.ts with path ':chapterId' (line 7) and resolver readingProfileResolver. Guards and resolvers run before ngOnInit, so they are steps with no parent.",
    "Route variant ':chapterId/list/:listId' (line 15) uses the same component; the component reads readingListId from the query string, not from :listId. With a reading list the next/prev calls go to api/readinglist/next-chapter and prev-chapter instead (reader.service.ts:245/252); not walked.",
    "Also in ngOnInit: the toObservable(persistableSettings) pipe (796) that auto-saves the profile via updateImplicit after the settings change (the first value is skipped, so it does not call at open), and the currentImage$ focus subscription (811); not followed.",
    "The constructor hides the nav bars, registers key bindings and settings effects (registerSettingsEffects); no requests. ngAfterViewInit adds scroll listeners only.",
    "init(true) is also reached by chapter changes with other arguments; this key covers the first load. setPageNum (1214) can request chapter info of the next/prev chapter near the ends, only after nextChapterId is known; not part of the first load and not followed.",
    "In bookmark mode the forkJoin branch is skipped (return at 1157); the bookmark branch loads the bookmark info instead.",
    "Persisting progress (saveProgress) is only called on page change (or when the chapter has one page, line 1187); not walked.",
    "Frontend base URL is environment.apiUrl ('.../api/'), so paths are under /api. The image URL carries the user's image auth key in apiKey."
  ]
